nd  ship in september and i think it'll  either come in the same exact chassis as  the current mac pro or they're gonna end  up shrinking it down by a little bit  potentially like this example that i  mocked up months ago so with that said  hopefully you enjoyed this video and if  you did go ahead and give me your  thoughts on all of this down in the  comment section below and click the  circle about to subscribe because we're  about to begin massive amounts of mac  studio testing this week so thanks for  watching and we'll see you in the next  video  [Music]

